   "shot": "A 28 mm medium-wide from the door end of the long conference table, looking straight down its length: Kyle seated at screen left and Gerald seated at screen right, in profile, facing each other across the table and its towers of white binders; the tallest tower stands at Kyle's left elbow. Gerald, deadpan, slides one tiny yellow sticky note across the table toward Kyle with one finger; Kyle stares at it. Behind them: a low credenza with a potted plant along the left wall, a beige filing cabinet at the back right. Harsh overhead fluorescent panels, flat and hard."
