 "style": "Harsh, flat overhead fluorescent office light in a real 1994 conference room with grey carpet and pale walls. Clean, sharp, natural photograph of a real place and real people at true scale: real skin and fabric, no grain, no noise, no painterly texture. No text.",
 "legend": {
  "colour": "Image 1 marks people as flat figures: light blue is Kyle (his khaki legs in tan), beige is Gerald. The room is in its real colours: the long dark brown slab is the wood conference table, white stacks are towers of white ring binders, the tiny yellow square is one small yellow sticky note, the thin blue slab is one blue folder, black chairs on five-star bases are office chairs, the low brown block along the left wall is a credenza with a potted plant, the beige block is a filing cabinet, white rectangles on the ceiling are fluorescent panels.",
  "clay": "In Image 1 the light blue figure is Kyle and the beige figure is Gerald; the long slab is the conference table and the white stacks are binder towers.",
